  "interpretation": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Clinical Utility:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1022\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Confirms diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1003\">Williams-Beuren Syndrome</strong>, characterized by:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1153\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1043\">Elfin facies</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1068\">developmental delay</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1103\">supravalvular aortic stenosis</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1122\">hypercalcemia</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1152\">friendly personality</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1243\">\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1243\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Useful for <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1189\">genetic counseling</strong>, prenatal diagnosis, and risk assessment in families.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
